<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Agresso lowered at Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Agresso lowered at Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian software specialist Agresso was cut to &quot;market underperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
